  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/340/winter-stress-tester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">透過這張壓力測試地圖，立即測試你的 FPS 表現。此地圖包含一個在村莊軌道上持續移動的礦車，天氣設定為雷雨天氣。請依照以下指示正確設定。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>使用說明</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 將你的視野設定為 Quake Pro</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 將所有影像設定調整至最大值。停用垂直同步，並將最大幀率改為無限制。詳情請參閱下方圖片。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 使用 ALT+F3 查看你的 FPS 及延遲波動。記錄你的最高、最低及平均 FPS。與模組（如 Sodium、OptiFine、Canvas）或啟動器（如 Lunar、Badlion 等）的測試結果進行比較。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>我的測試結果：-<br>（未安裝模組，使用 Fabric Loader）<br></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>最高 FPS - 31</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>最低 FPS - 19</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>平均 FPS - 25</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/343/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/344/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/345/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1578\" height=\"888\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/346/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一同遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
